#!/usr/bin/env node
// solve — CLI for the minimal autonomy-first solver.
//
// The registered subcommands are the keys of the COMMANDS map below. For the
// COMPLETE, always-current reference (purpose + usage for every subcommand), see
// the generated docs/steering/llm/solve-commands.md (regenerated by
// `npm run steering:llm:pack` from this file + docs/steering/solve-commands.json).
// Do not maintain a hand-curated list here — it drifts.
//
// The CLI is a thin shell over scripts/solve/*. All Quest truth lives in the
// append-only log; reports and state are projections.

